      "value": "<p>The smallest known dog in the Empire, the Leden Lapdog is so minute as to appear almost magical to those not used to its diminutive size. Named for its supposed origins in Wissenland, the Leden is an extraordinarily prized dog in the courts of Nuln, Averheim, and Altdorf, but is also so expensive that the white puff-ball of soft fur is an extremely rare sight.</p>"
